    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like a resting season though. it feels more like the well is actually dry. i keep waiting for that feeling to come back, that spark, but it's just... silence. it feels like i'm just a shell of a person now, going through the motions of a life that doesn't even belong to me anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
